<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Special+Elite&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>—</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 12%, #170c00, #0a0806 60%, #050403);
    color: #d8c9a8;
    font-family: "Special Elite", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px;
  }
  .page {
    width: 100%; max-width: 620px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1b130a, #140d06);
    border: 1px solid #3a2a16; border-radius: 3px; padding: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.75), inset 0 0 120px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  }
  h1 {
    font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-size: 34px; margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: #f0e3c2; text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(214,168,92,0.28);
  }
  p { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.7; color: #cdbb93; }
  .sig { margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic; font-size: 15px; color: #8a744d; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>I am here.</h1>
    <p>This house belonged to them.</p>
    <p>This is my home now.</p>
    <p>The cards can show you the way.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
